Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, certbot, curl, git, libc6, libstdc++6, nginx, openssh-client, python3-certbot-dns-cloudflare, xz-utils
Description: Yunsoft server and hosting control plane
 YunPanel provides an authenticated Node.js management API, privileged local
 host runtime and restricted web dashboard used to manage Yunsoft hosts.
 Management operations run directly through the privileged local host runtime.
